"Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat and Dream Catcher.": t("Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat und Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat и Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat і Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat i Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat y Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat e Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat et Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat e Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat ve Dream Catcher.","Lightning Roulette, Crazy Time, Blackjack, Mega Wheel, Baccarat en Dream Catcher."),
